      238.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE EXCISE ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 52)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      250.97,
      401.91,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.89,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)Act, No. of 2017 and shall come into operation onJanuary 1, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.9,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 15 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) ishereby amended by the repeal of paragraphs (b) and (c) ofthat section, and the substitution therefor of the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.13,
      382.97,
      401.88,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b)no tree producing toddy, other than kithul tree shallbe tapped;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      419.45,
      401.89,
      443.03
    ],
    "text": "(c)no toddy shall be drawn or lowered from any treeother than the kithul tree.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      456.17,
      401.9,
      481.07
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
